      "content": "<!--\n  Panel, Divider, Button, ButtonIcon, and ButtonLabel come from the bundled\n  Horizon kit. RectangleGoggles and LogIn are bundled Lucide icon components.\n-->\n<style>\n  @font-face {\n    font-family: \"DM Sans\";\n    src: url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/dmsans/v17/rP2tp2ywxg089UriI5-g4vlH9VoD8CmcqZG40F9JadbnoEwAopxhTg.ttf\");\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  @font-face {\n    font-family: \"DM Sans\";\n    src: url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/dmsans/v17/rP2tp2ywxg089UriI5-g4vlH9VoD8CmcqZG40F9JadbnoEwAkJxhTg.ttf\");\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  @font-face {\n    font-family: \"DM Sans\";\n    src: url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/dmsans/v17/rP2tp2ywxg089UriI5-g4vlH9VoD8CmcqZG40F9JadbnoEwARZthTg.ttf\");\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .panel-root {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    font-family: \"DM Sans\";\n    width: 344px;\n  }\n\n  .panel-content {\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n    padding-left: 24px;\n    padding-right: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .heading {\n    height: 48px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    color: #272727;\n  }\n\n  .heading:dark {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  }\n\n  .sub-heading {\n    color: #272727;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .sub-heading:dark {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  }\n\n  .button {\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    margin-left: 24px;\n    margin-right: 24px;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .button-label {\n    transform-translate-y: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n<Panel class=\"panel-root\">\n  <div class=\"panel-content\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">Hello, Immersive Web!</div>\n    <Divider></Divider>\n    <div class=\"sub-heading\">\n      Build interactive browser, mixed-reality, and virtual-reality experiences\n      with Immersive Web SDK.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <Button id=\"xr-button\" class=\"button\">\n    <ButtonIcon>\n      <RectangleGoggles></RectangleGoggles>\n    </ButtonIcon>\n    <ButtonLabel class=\"button-label\">Enter XR</ButtonLabel>\n  </Button>\n  <Button id=\"exit-button\" class=\"button\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <ButtonIcon>\n      <LogIn></LogIn>\n    </ButtonIcon>\n    <ButtonLabel class=\"button-label\">Exit to Browser</ButtonLabel>\n  </Button>\n</Panel>\n",
      "type": "registry:file",
      "target": "~/public/ui/welcome.uikitml"
